@node Overview
@chapter Overview
@cindex overview

Use @code{colorful -l rust} to force a language; see @ref{Invoking}.
Files such as @file{~/.colorfulrc} hold settings for @var{user}.
Braces are written as @{ and @}, and an at sign as @@.
Visit @uref{https://example.com, the web site}@dots{}

@example
colorful --theme dark src/main.rs
@end example

